        "author": "Aung Moe Khine",
        "maintainer": "Aung Moe Khine <aungmoekhine@gmail.com>",
        "sentence": "Universal standalone TFT, touch, sprite, TFT_eSPI_Button, gradients, and visual GUI driver with 1-line autoSetup and adaptive multi-point autoCalibrate for ESP32 CYD resistive & capacitive boards and ESP32-S3 RGB capacitive boards.",
        "paragraph": "Bundles high-speed display and touch drivers with runtime hardware auto-probing for 2.4\", 2.8\", 3.2\", 3.5\", and 4.0\" CYD resistive and capacitive boards (ILI9341, ST7789, ST7796, XPT2046, GT911, CST820) and ESP32-S3 parallel RGB boards (4.3\", 5.0\", 7.0\" 800x480 ST7262 + GT911 capacitive touch). Features 1-line universal hardware auto-setup (tft.autoSetup()), adaptive multi-point statistical touch calibration with NVS persistence (tft.autoCalibrate()), built-in ambient light auto-dimming with LDR moving average filtering (tft.adjustBrightness()), universal Active-LOW RGB LED control (tft.setRgbLed()), dual touch controller auto-detection, half-duplex SPI readback on SDA, persistent NVS hardware overrides, full TFT_eSPI and TFT_eSPI_Button drop-in compatibility, linear vertical & horizontal color gradients, alpha blending, TFT_eSprite off-screen buffering, zero-boilerplate LVGL v8/v9 integration, PlatformIO/Visual Studio support, and seamless SquareLine Studio / EEZ Studio visual GUI builder support.",
        "category": "Display",
